WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.490
Step 1. Open the valueset list. Here you change a facility valueset,

1.2
00:00:05.490 --> 00:00:09.188
or retire one that your facility no longer uses.

1.3
00:00:09.188 --> 00:00:13.001
In Settings, under Forms, select ValueSets.

2.1
00:00:13.001 --> 00:00:17.873
Step 2. Find the valueset. Type its name in Search ValueSets.

2.2
00:00:17.873 --> 00:00:24.587
The list shows Active valuesets, so change Status to find one with another status.

3.1
00:00:24.587 --> 00:00:30.153
Step 3. Open the valueset. On the row of the valueset, select Edit.

3.2
00:00:30.153 --> 00:00:33.350
Care opens the Edit ValueSet page.

4.1
00:00:33.350 --> 00:00:35.466
Step 4. Change the details.

4.2
00:00:35.466 --> 00:00:39.475
Change the Name, the Status, the Description or the rules.

4.3
00:00:39.475 --> 00:00:45.505
You cannot change the slug, and changes to Departments with access save at once.

5.1
00:00:45.505 --> 00:00:48.756
Step 5. Save the changes. Select Save.

5.2
00:00:48.756 --> 00:00:55.179
Care shows ValueSet updated successfully and returns to the ValueSets page.

6.1
00:00:55.179 --> 00:01:01.759
Step 6. Retire the valueset. Open it again, set Status to Retired, and select Save.

6.2
00:01:01.759 --> 00:01:12.704
There is no delete action. To use it again, set its status back to Active.
